# Build context exclusions.
#
# The dev database scripts are the notable ones: dev/db/99-seed.sql is 1.8 MB of
# generated SQL and has no business in a production image. It is used by
# `docker-compose.dev.yml` via a bind mount, not by the image.
.git
.gitignore
.github
node_modules
.next
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
dev
tests
justfile
*.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.idea
.vscode